   ATA = Allen Telescope Array, Hat Creek Radio Observatory, California
   (bistatic RX for the 2025-09-16 session; RX prefix "ata_radar_*").
   Array-reference LATLON from Hat Creek Radio Observatory
   (40.8178 N, 121.4733 W, ~1008 m). Position precision (~10 m horizontal)
   is far below the per-look timing/Doppler calibration that absorbs any
   constant station offset, so the modest published precision is adequate.